\paragraph{Organization}
Section~\ref{sec:preliminaries} introduces the problem class, the KKT and
game-stationarity criteria, the SPLALM family, and the complexity measure,
and shows that every member of the family has the effective penalty
$\rho+s$. Section~\ref{sec:lower-bound} states the lower bound for constant
center stepsizes, and Section~\ref{sec:lb-proof} proves it.
Section~\ref{sec:upper-bound} proves the $\mathcal O(\epsilon^{-3})$
upper bound with a fixed penalty.
