$\rho+s$. Section~\ref{sec:lower-bound} states the lower bound for constant
center stepsizes, and Section~\ref{sec:lb-proof} proves it.
Section~\ref{sec:upper-bound} proves the $\mathcal O(\epsilon^{-3})$
upper bound with a fixed penalty.
